@startuml diagramme_deploiement
!theme plain
skinparam dpi 300

title Diagramme de déploiement — IAT Academy

node "Serveur (VPS / Docker Compose)" {

  node "Conteneur nginx\n(deploy/nginx/conf.d/elearning.conf)" as Nginx {
    component "Reverse proxy\n:80" as ProxyComp
  }

  node "Conteneur api\n(backend/Dockerfile)" as ApiNode {
    component "Spring Boot\n:8080" as ApiComp
  }

  node "Conteneur frontend" as FrontNode {
    component "Next.js\n:3000" as FrontComp
  }

  node "Conteneur postgres\n(postgres:16-alpine)" as DbNode {
    database "PostgreSQL\n:5432 (exposé host 5433)" as DbComp
  }

  node "Conteneur redis\n(redis:7-alpine, --appendonly yes)" as RedisNode {
    database "Redis\n:6379" as RedisComp
  }

  folder "Volume ./data/media" as MediaVolume
  folder "Volume postgres_data" as PgVolume
  folder "Volume redis_data" as RedisVolume
}

cloud "Services externes" {
  [Gemini / Grok API] as LlmCloud
  [Bunny Stream] as BunnyCloud
  [SMTP] as SmtpCloud
}

actor "Utilisateur" as User

User --> ProxyComp : HTTPS

ProxyComp --> FrontComp : "/ " (+ upgrade WebSocket)
ProxyComp --> ApiComp : "/api/", "/swagger-ui/", "/api-docs"

ApiComp --> DbComp : JDBC (Flyway migrations)
ApiComp --> RedisComp : rate-limit, verrous, sessions
ApiComp --> MediaVolume : PDF / images (data/media)
ApiComp --> LlmCloud : génération de questions IA
ApiComp --> BunnyCloud : upload / streaming vidéo
ApiComp --> SmtpCloud : campagnes email, notifications

DbNode ..> PgVolume
RedisNode ..> RedisVolume

note bottom of ApiNode
  État actuel de docker-compose.yml (racine du projet) :
  seuls les services postgres et redis sont activés.
  Les services api / frontend / nginx représentés ici
  correspondent à la topologie cible, déjà anticipée par
  deploy/nginx/conf.d/elearning.conf (upstreams iat_api /
  iat_frontend), à activer dans une étape ultérieure.
end note

@enduml
